",\"\\\\(502.4\\\\ \\\\mathrm{N/m}\\\\)\",\"\\\\(15791\\\\ \\\\mathrm{N/m}\\\\)\"],\"ans\":1,\"why\":\"\\\\(T=2\\\\pi\\\\sqrt{\\\\frac{m}{K}}\\\\Rightarrow K=\\\\frac{4\\\\pi^2m}{T^2}=\\\\frac{4\\\\pi^2\\\\times64}{(0.8)^2}=3947.84\\\\ \\\\mathrm{N/m}\\\\)।\"}]"
